# Claude Code — .gitignore entries
# Add these to your project's .gitignore

# Personal local Claude instructions (project-specific, not for team)
CLAUDE.local.md

# Claude Code project settings that may contain personal config
# Note: .claude/settings.json is usually safe to commit (contains shared config)
# Uncomment below only if your settings.json has personal/sensitive data:
# .claude/settings.local.json

# Auto-generated memory files (Claude writes these itself)
# These live in ~/.claude/projects/ not in your project, so usually no action needed.
# If you've configured a custom memory path inside the project:
# .claude/memory/

# Claude Code session state (not typically stored in project dir)
# .claude/sessions/
